      "cooked": "<p><a href=\"http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/system/files/downloads/Sentinels%20of%20the%20Multiverse%20Enhanced%20Edition%20Rulebook.pdf\">The current rulebook</a> actually has a compete list of the available damage types on the bottom of page 7:</p>\n<p>\"The <strong>Sentinels of the Multiverse </strong>damage types are: cold, energy, fire, infernal, lightning, melee, projectile, psychic, radiant, sonic, and toxic\"</p>\n<p>It also mentions that \"Damage can be irreducible, regardless of its type.\"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(Oddly, it neglected to include Fluffy Bunny damage.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> )</p>",
